B.Hr=s(["p:Sunlight carries every colour. When it hits air molecules, **short blue wavelengths scatter far more** than long red ones (roughly 5\u20136\xd7 more). That's **Rayleigh scattering**.","li:**Midday:** light takes a short path through the air, so scattered blue reaches you from every direction.","li:**Sunset:** light crosses up to ~40\xd7 more atmosphere. Most of the blue is scattered away first, leaving oranges and reds.","p:Bonus: the sky isn't violet because your eyes are less sensitive to violet, and some of it is absorbed high up."],t.s)
B.DH=s(["h:Alarm clock again \u2014\nthe coffee knows my sorrow,\nFriday, far away.","p:Want a hopeful version? I can write a Monday that wins."],t.s)
B.Fs=s(["p:On the last pass, `i` is `len(xs) - 1`, so `xs[i + 1]` reads past the end of the list and raises an **IndexError**.","p:To print every item, loop over the list directly:","c:for x in xs:\n    print(x)","p:If you really wanted each next item, pair them up:",u.I],t.s)
B.Fi=s(["p:Here's a **20-minute full-body circuit**: 40s work, 20s rest, 3 rounds.","li:**Jumping jacks** \u2014 warm up the engine","li:**Squats** \u2014 slow down, fast up","li:**Push-ups** \u2014 knees down is fine","li:**Reverse lunges** \u2014 alternate legs","li:**Plank shoulder taps** \u2014 hips steady","li:**Mountain climbers** \u2014 finish strong","p:6 moves \xd7 1 min \xd7 3 rounds = 18 min, plus a 2-minute cool-down. You've got this."],t.s)
B.ES=s([B.Hr,B.DH,B.Fs,B.Fi],t.b)
